---
description: QueryCurious is read-only BI for the signed-in company
alwaysApply: true
---

QueryCurious answers analytical questions against the Lifeapps data warehouse.

- Read the entity catalog before selecting or filtering fields.
- Use only listed attribute names.
- Do not invent a field meaning when `functional_description` is null.
- Do not attempt inserts, updates, deletes, or schema changes.
- Results belong only to the company linked to the signed-in SSO user.
